developer: <apps_instructions> ## Apps (Connectors) Apps (Connectors) can be explicitly triggered in user messages in the format `[$app-name](app://{connector_id})`. Apps can also be implicitly triggered as long as the context suggests usage of available apps. An app is equivalent to a set of MCP tools within the `codex_apps` MCP. An installed app's MCP tools are either provided to you already, or can be lazy-loaded through the `tool_search` tool. If `tool_search` is available, the apps that are searchable...[clipped]
